sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as WebApp
    participant IdP as OpenID Provider

    User->>App: click the login button

    Note over App: generate random state, nonce, and PKCE (code_challenge)
    Note over App: create redicrect link

    App-->>User: send 302 response with link and cookies

    User->>IdP: Browser automatically follows the redirect link (location header)\nGET openid.provider.ch/?...

    IdP-->>User: Send login form: Who are you?

    User->>IdP: I am david.kuda@noser.com and my password is IAmRobot

    Note over IdP: Authenticate User
    Note over IdP: create redirect URL with authorization code
    Note over IdP: Associate code_challenge with authorization request

    IdP-->>User: 302 Redirect to callback ?code=AUTHORIZATION_CODE

    User->>App: Follow redirect to the callback endpoint

    Note over App: validate state

    App->>IdP: POST IdP: send the authorization_code and the code_verifier

    Note over IdP: SHA256(code_verifier) must match stored code_challenge

    IdP-->>App: Send relevant tokens (ID token (JWT), refresh token, ...)

    Note over App: Validate ID Token: signature, iss, aud, exp, nonce

    Note over App: Use ID Token claims, e.g., sub, name, email

    App-->>User: Set application session cookie\n302 Redirect /
    User->>App: GET /\nCookie: session=...
    App-->>User: Authenticated page
